sub1:assertion {
    <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1002849> a pk:Paper ;
        dcterms:bibliographicCitation "PLoS Computational Biology 9(1):e1002849 (2013)" ;
        dcterms:creator "Chindapol N, Kaandorp JA, Cronemberger C, Mass T, Genin A" ;
        dcterms:identifier "doi:10.1371/journal.pcbi.1002849" ;
        dcterms:title "Modelling Growth and Form of the Scleractinian Coral Pocillopora verrucosa and the Influence of Hydrodynamics" .

    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/2013-chindapol-coral-flow.py> a prov:Entity,
